{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104207","id":2395774360,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6OzJ2Y","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104207","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104207.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104207.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104207","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104207/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104207/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104207/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/e3c215fc13085a8447ba68c55c06c26a9da0d643","number":104207,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add support for Direct3D 12 OpenXR backend","user":{"login":"mbucchia","id":69611560,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5NjExNTYw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69611560?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbucchia","html_url":"https://github.com/mbucchia","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbucchia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbucchia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbucchia/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbucchia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbucchia/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbucchia/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbucchia/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbucchia/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbucchia/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Add support for Direct3D 12 OpenXR backend and rendering with view\r\ninstancing (#86283). See godotengine/godot-proposals#10078.\r\n\r\nThis change adds support for running XR projects built with the `d3d12`\r\nrendering backend. The XR backend hooks into the setup for the D3D12\r\nrender context in order to use the desired device and command queue for\r\nsubmission to OpenXR. The XR backend takes care of importing the D3D12\r\nswapchain images into the render context.\r\n\r\nAs part of this process, three issues are addressed:\r\n- Ensuring that resource state transitions are only done on textures\r\n  that require them.\r\n- Enabling view instancing in the PSOs for multiview render passes.\r\n- Addressing a bug in the D3D12 runtime where PSO creation may fail\r\n  when front face detection is used.\r\n\r\nPlease refer to #86283 for additional discussions on the implementation\r\ndetails.\r\n\r\nFixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/86283\r\n\r\n----8<----8<----8<----8<----8<----8<----8<----8<----8<----8<----8<----\r\n(remove content below from commit message when squashing this pull request)\r\n\r\nFor testing, I have been using the https://github.com/GodotVR/godot-xr-template and set it up for D3D12 rendering:\r\n\r\n```\r\n--- a/project.godot\r\n+++ b/project.godot\r\n@@ -54,8 +54,12 @@ common/drop_mouse_on_gui_input_disabled=true\r\n\r\n [rendering]\r\n\r\n-renderer/rendering_method=\"gl_compatibility\"\r\n-renderer/rendering_method.mobile=\"gl_compatibility\"\r\n+rendering_device/driver=\"d3d12\"\r\n+rendering_device/driver.windows=\"d3d12\"\r\n+;rendering_device/d3d12/agility_sdk_version=615\r\n+rendering_device/fallback_to_vulkan=false\r\n+rendering_device/fallback_to_opengl3=false\r\n+renderer/rendering_method.mobile=\"forward_plus\"\r\n textures/vram_compression/import_etc2_astc=true\r\n environment/defaults/default_environment=\"res://default_env.tres\"\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\nTesting:\r\n- Nvidia Ada Lovelace + godot-xr-template + Virtual Desktop (VDXR): PASS\r\n- Nvidia Ada Lovelace + godot-xr-template + Varjo: PASS\r\n- Nvidia Ada Lovelace + godot-xr-template + Meta XR Simulator: PASS\r\n- Nvidia Ada Lovelace + godot-xr-template + Meta Quest Link: PASS\r\n- Nvidia Ada Lovelace + godot-xr-template + SteamVR: PASS\r\n- Nvidia Ada Lovelace + godot-xr-template + Windows Mixed Reality: FAIL [1]\r\n- AMD RDNA2 + godot-xr-template + Virtual Desktop (VDXR): PASS\r\n- Intel ARC + godot-xr-template + Virtual Desktop (VDXR): PASS\r\n- godot-xr-template + Agility SDK 615: PASS\r\n- godot-xr-template + `--gpu-validation`: PASS\r\n\r\n[1] Disappointingly, there is an issue with WMR and we crash in `xrCreateSwapchain()` pretty inexplicably. This is not a bug with this change however.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":205417413,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMDU0MTc0MTM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:windows","name":"platform:windows","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":865585000,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4NjU1ODUwMDA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:xr","name":"topic:xr","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","number":22,"state":"closed","title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ